          "quote": "m=\\frac r2\\left(1+4\\Omega^{-2}r_u r_v\\right).\\"
        }
      ],
      "note": "仅统一显示转义，不改变原质量定义。"
    },
    {
      "id": "MetricConvention",
      "text": "采用双零度规 \\(g=-\\Omega^2du\\,dv+r^2d\\omega_{\\mathbb S^2}^2\\)，即 \\(g_{uv}=g_{vu}=-\\Omega^2/2\\)。",
      "origin": "model_suggestion",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "S-fe97531a6db089a02aba279b",
          "start_line": 1,
          "end_line": 1,
          "quote": "你自己定"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "S-e262ac7a0d009fc269d693ae",
          "start_line": 3,
          "end_line": 3,
          "quote": "标量场记为 phi，采用 g=-Omega^2 du dv+r^2 d omega_{S^2}^2，因此 g_uv=g_vu=-Omega^2/2。"
        }
      ],
      "note": "用户授权自行选择后确定的本次约定，不是原题已经指定的内容。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ScalarNormalization",
      "text": "标量场记为 \\(\\phi\\)，采用 \\(\\operatorname{Ric}_{ab}=2\\partial_a\\phi\\partial_b\\phi\\) 的归一化，无电磁场和宇宙学常数项。",
      "origin": "model_suggestion",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "S-fe97531a6db089a02aba279b",
